# Extra defaults layered on top of copter.parm (see Dockerfile --defaults list).
#
# Stream-rate defaults (Hz) for SERIAL0 (droneserver/MavSDK) and SERIAL1
# (test-harness readiness probe). A raw SITL binary - unlike a sim_vehicle.py
# setup - has no MAVProxy attached to request telemetry streams, so without
# these the autopilot never sends GLOBAL_POSITION_INT, SYS_STATUS, etc., and
# MavSDK telemetry subscriptions block forever.
SR0_EXT_STAT 2
SR0_POSITION 4
SR0_EXTRA1 4
SR0_EXTRA2 4
SR0_EXTRA3 2
SR0_RAW_SENS 2
SR0_RC_CHAN 2
SR1_EXT_STAT 2
SR1_POSITION 4
SR1_EXTRA1 4
SR1_EXTRA2 4
SR1_EXTRA3 2
SR1_RAW_SENS 2
SR1_RC_CHAN 2
